{"server":"tw","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_10_beg","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_10","title":"1:11A.M.","storyCode":"CB-10","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_10_beg.txt","sourceHash":"05894a318a2076e7d578b3996406a030ee451a3602c9625d57adf5f6c86db81a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"鼠王統領的本地幫派和收編的黑手黨一起對企鵝物流發起了猛攻，莫斯提馬親自牽制鼠王，拜松也終於打開心結，加入戰局。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"鼠爺爺~！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼是你這小妮子，一個人跑來幹嘛啦？灰頭土臉的，又鑽通風管了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，鼠爺爺，這是大門口的何叔給我的！何叔說我個子小跑得快，一刻鐘之內送到就請我吃優酪乳！你要給我作證！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"好，爺爺給你作證。你先去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝爺爺！爺爺再見~！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看似普通的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺子。怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"還記得來找過我們的那幾個敘拉古人嗎？他們的“家族”已經完全從敘拉古轉移到了龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看似普通的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"需要聯繫線人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"沒必要，按兵不動，他們會找上門來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看似普通的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"為了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"為了在這裡生存下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看似普通的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"這可不需要經過任何人的同意，那他們怎麼不去和天災聊聊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"天災要是會說話，興許就用不著人們窩裡鬥了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"——正如您所言，鼠王先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門有自己的規則，魏彥吾在十幾年前就默認了這個鐵律，我們絕不敢輕易違反。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"但您才是執行者，這也是我們今天冒昧來訪的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們想剷除企鵝物流，取而代之。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"正是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你們對他們缺乏瞭解，西西里人。這筆生意你們得不到任何好處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"（甘比諾！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在說我們贏不了嗎？“鼠王”先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"“輸贏”不是談生意的時候應該出現的詞，也難怪你逃離了敘拉古，你的確不是那個女人的對手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_028","isRemote":false,"text":"你敢侮辱我的家族？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"你閉嘴，甘比諾！我們要的是針對企鵝物流的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"只要遵循規則，我沒有庇護企鵝物流的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"——意思是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"企鵝物流是明面上的合法公司，能庇護他們的只有龍門的鋼鐵律法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"不過他們有時候的確觸犯了各方面的問題，而且從來不以為然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"但是切記，西西里人，切記不要越界。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"另類的秩序不代表沒有秩序，敘拉古應當最明白這個道理。可千萬別再麻煩我這把老骨頭動手了，答應我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_027","isRemote":false,"text":"——我明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......龍門這個季節的星星，比想像中的多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"放在桌上的茶，也涼了吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是老爺的......喂，上工了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不聾，趕緊打，打完正好去喝早茶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看來輪到我們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"反正之前也打過招呼了，把弩槍都放下，注意不要誤傷到無關人士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......該適應新的規則了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是不是被包了個圓？裡三層外三層的那種？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，戚風蛋糕卷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"鼠王是貧民窟的話事人，他的爪牙自然無處不在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼不早說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為那只是個都市傳說，而且我也不知道他真的是隻老鼠。誰會這麼取外號？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"說什麼人流密集不好動手，這哪裡有什麼無辜民眾，明明全是敵人嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"寸步難行呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"現在怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直在問怎麼辦，不如你自己想想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"要來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......你來了。這裡能清楚地看見下面的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你的朋友們正陷入苦戰，你不打算去幫個忙嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我可沒聽說你會下這麼重的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不是所有事都會和年輕人推心置腹的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"也是，我總是會忘記，你是個什麼樣的人物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"很多人會忘記這一點，他們都死無葬身之地。你已經屬於特別優待了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你殺了老闆，這件事不會這麼簡單地過去喔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，我心裡明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"企鵝物流和他們的主人過於目中無人了，龍門在變化，不能總由著他們為所欲為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"他們欠缺一個教訓，稍微嚴厲一些的教訓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"過河拆橋的事情做多了，會遭到報應的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"你借企鵝物流的手做了那麼多事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你一開始就打算這麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"誰知道呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能的吧，你對自己應該扮演的角色拿捏得那麼好。嗯，起碼比我好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac5_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵......你真的很聰明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"火焰在回應你的意志，你這是打算把我送進墓地裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是非常尊老愛幼的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提馬！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，能天使，被包圍的是我們，不要打亂陣型。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁——！稍等！我馬上就過來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"這些傢伙混在普通市民之間，完全沒法好好戰鬥啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"這都是什麼和什麼啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"拜松，別發呆啊，你擋著我了！快閃開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"每個人都是，各顧各的，就這樣該怎麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"既然總是這樣，那就，各按各的來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"聽得見嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"通訊？給誰的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"小心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"專心點，空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"你在的，對吧？一直都在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"少爺......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"我不怪你，多半是父親多管閒事吧。但是現在，你得幫我一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......明白了，少爺請吩咐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"眼前這仗勢，還用吩咐什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"把他們打飛就完事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"竟然會從少爺的嘴裡聽到這樣的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"容我替老爺問一句，為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......我哪管那麼多為什麼！可頌姐，讓一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"噢噢——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"喝啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"撞、撞飛了！？這下不是和我的定位重合了嘛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......就結果而言，老爺應該會滿意的，但少爺繼續這樣......真的不會被企鵝物流帶偏嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"管家","speakerId":"avg_npc_029","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不能繼續妨害少爺了，只要少爺覺得可以，那就可以，嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"你這小子！乖乖躺下不好嗎！一起上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"被躲開了！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫B","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"唔哦、痛！我的棍子被什麼東西打飛了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫A","speakerId":"avg_npc_031","isRemote":false,"text":"小心，有狙擊手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"給我讓開！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"......雖然是有在控制力度啦，但你一步都沒動過，是不是太不講理了點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"站著不動，也不代表自己很輕鬆啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"在龍門真的有什麼可以打敗你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"有啊，“龍門”可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，狡猾的回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是有堅持每天去公園晨練的，上了年紀，保持健康可是很重要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"晨練會有這種效果？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"還要加上一點點人生閱歷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"那兩個敘拉古人如何了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"如何了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"......真想知道，每天有多少這樣見不得光的事情被你悄悄解決了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"或者說，你讓那些企圖染指龍門的人自相殘殺了多少次？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"記不清了，孩子。我只記得為了活下去而前仆後繼的傢伙，遠比下水道裡的屍體要多，多得多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提馬小姐！我來幫——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看似普通的居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不許再靠近了。你們幾個，去幫老大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑幫&路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會讓你得逞！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看似普通的居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"狙擊？小少爺的保鏢嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"讓開！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看似普通的居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你只是個普通的信使，你不該摻和進來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"信使？沒錯，我只是個信使。但是我們身後身前的那幾位最鬧騰的，好像都是信使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看似普通的居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯他們和你不一樣，現在退出這場戰鬥，你還能保全自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......你說了算？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看似普通的居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！你還是有點本事的嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"char_213_mostma","isRemote":false,"text":"放手去做就對了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"——明白！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克薩斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["可頌"]},{"speakerId":"char_213_mostma","aliases":["莫斯提馬"]},{"speakerId":"char_325_bison","aliases":["拜松"]}]}
